# The First Meeting (bastok 52): the NMs' deaths with the San d'Orian Martial Arts Scroll held set no nmKilled bit. The
# scroll is GM-given while both are still up. nmKilled is a local var, not in the trace, and with the scroll held the
# next 108 says YOU_FIND_NOTHING either way: this flow takes the arm, the trace cannot tell its effect.
char zone=Davoi pos=-126,4,20 job=MNK lvl=75
quest Bastok.GhostsOfThePast completed
quest Bastok.TheFirstMeeting accepted
keyitem LetterFromDalzakk
login
trigger Hide_Flap_2 at=0.5      # 108
finish                          # the letter, neither spawned: YOU_FIND_NOTHING, both NMs spawned
keyitem SanDorianMartialArtsScroll
kill BILOPDOP                   # the scroll held: no bit
kill DELOKNOK                   # the scroll held: no bit
trigger Hide_Flap_2 at=0.5      # 108
finish                          # the scroll held: YOU_FIND_NOTHING
